        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Beaver Creek State Park, Los Angeles\n- Systems: Sandy and Beaver Canal, Los Angeles Aqueduct\n- Topics: canal operations, historic remnants\n\nFacts:\n- The Sandy and Beaver Canal has historic remnants in Beaver Creek State Park.\n- The Los Angeles Aqueduct remained operational until a later date than the Sandy and Beaver Canal.\n- The Sandy and Beaver Canal did not remain operational as long as the Los Angeles Aqueduct.",
